      "text": "hear of wars and rumours of wars, Matt. 24:6 (Mark 13:7; Luke 21:9; 2 Ne. 25:12; Morm. 8:30; JS—M 1:23, 28). what king, going to make war against another, Luke 14:31. warring against the law of my mind, Rom. 7:23. we do not war after the flesh, 2 Cor. 10:3. thou by them mightest war a good warfare, 1 Tim. 1:18. No man that warreth entangleth himself, 2 Tim. 2:4. whence come wars and fightings, James 4:1. fleshly lusts, which war against the soul, 1 Pet. 2:11. there was war in heaven, Rev. 12:7. dragon … went to make war with the remnant of her seed, Rev. 12:17. given unto him to make war with the saints, Rev. 13:7. These shall make war with the Lamb, Rev. 17:14. in righteousness he doth judge and make war, Rev. 19:11. gathered together to make war against him, Rev. 19:19.",
